noise measurement.\\nThe input file is the Nii file that conatins the \
individualy reconstruted coil images and the noise data.\\nInternaly it uses \
CoilSNRCalc and SumOfSquares. \\n\\nOutput is the coil data with coil noise \
data and snrmap based on the SumOfSquares addition, the SOS reconstruction \
and the SOS weights.\\n{dataC, noiseC, sosC, snrC, sigmapC, weights, \
