  InformationData[
   Association[
   "ObjectType" -> "Symbol", "Usage" -> 
    "IVIMCalc[data, binp, init] calculates the IVIM fit.\n \ndata should be \
1D ,2D, 3D or 4D. \nbinp should be full bmatrix which can be calculated from \
the bvecs en bvals using Bmatrix with the bvalues in s/mm^2. \ninit should \
are the initialization parameters for 2 components this is {S0, f, D, Dp} for \
3 componentes this is {S0, f1, f2, D, Dp1, Dp2}.\n\nThe fraction is defined \
between 0 and 1, the D, Dp, Dp1 and Dp2 is in mm^2/s.\n\noutput is {S0, f1, \
D, pD1} or {S0, f1, f2, D, pD1, pD2}.", "Documentation" -> 
    Association["Local" -> "paclet:QMRITools/ref/IVIMCalc"], "OwnValues" -> 
